Package: xampp-linux
Version: 3.3.0-1
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-pyqt6, apache2, libapache2-mod-php, php-mysql, php-mbstring, php-xml, php-curl, php-gd, php-zip, mysql-server | mariadb-server, phpmyadmin, openssl, iproute2, procps
Recommends: mysql-client | mariadb-client, xdg-utils
Suggests: tomcat10 | tomcat9, gnome-terminal | konsole | xfce4-terminal | xterm
Maintainer: XAMPP Control Panel for Linux <noreply@localhost>
Description: XAMPP-style control panel for Apache, MySQL, PHP and phpMyAdmin
 A desktop replica of the XAMPP Control Panel for Windows. Start and stop
 Apache (HTTP and HTTPS), MySQL and Tomcat as your own user, with no root
 needed. It detects what is already installed on the machine, resolves
 port conflicts, can install modules as systemd user services and explains
 failures instead of just reporting that a module shut down unexpectedly.
